title: "ARN: A Sub-18MB Non-Generative Joint Encoder-CRF Model for Real-Time On-Device Tool Orchestration"
abstract: "A non-generative joint neural architecture reformulating edge tool orchestration as multi-label Factored Attention Routing (FAR) and Linear-Chain Conditional Random Field (CRF) token tagging atop a frozen BERT-tiny encoder trunk."
